{"t":"ACGL","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Arch Capital Group Ltd.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","employees":8000,"hq":"Pembroke, Bermuda","website":"https://www.archgroup.com","summary_en":"Arch Capital Group Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, provides insurance, reinsurance, and mortgage insurance products in the United States, Canada, Bermuda, the United Kingdom, Europe, and Australia. The company operates through three segments: Insurance, Reinsurance, and Mortgage. The Insurance segment offers commercial automobile; commercial multiperil; financial and professional line liability; admitted, excess, and surplus casualty lines; property and short-tail specialty; workers compensation; and casualty insurance. Its Reinsurance segment provides reinsurance products for casualty; marine and aviation; property catastrophe; property excluding property catastrophe; and other specialty products. The Mortgage segment offers U.S. primary mortgage insurance business written predominantly on loans sold to the Federal National Mortgage Association and Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corporation; reinsurance and underwriting services related to the U.S. credit-risk transfer business and other U.S. mortgage reinsurance transactions; and international mortgage insurance and reinsurance business covering loans. It markets its products through a group of licensed independent retail and wholesale brokers. The company was formerly known as Risk Capital Holdings, Inc. Arch Capital Group Ltd. was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Pembroke, Bermuda.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Arch Capital Group Ltd.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 캐나다, 버뮤다, 영국, 유럽 및 호주에서 보험, 재보험 및 모기지 보험 상품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 보험, 재보험, 모기지의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 보험 부문은 상업용 자동차를 제공합니다. 상업적인 다중 위험; 재정적 및 직업적 책임; 인정, 초과 및 잉여 사상자 라인; 부동산 및 짧은 꼬리 전문 분야; 근로자 보상; 그리고 상해 보험. 재보험 부문은 부상자를 위한 재보험 상품을 제공합니다. 해양 및 항공; 재산재해; 재산재해를 제외한 재산; 그리고 다른 특산품. 모기지 부문은 주로 연방 국립 모기지 협회(Federal National Mortgage Association) 및 연방 주택 융자 모기지 공사(Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corporation)에 판매된 대출을 기반으로 작성된 미국 1차 모기지 보험 사업을 제공합니다. 미국 신용 위험 이전 사업 및 기타 미국 모기지 재보험 거래와 관련된 재보험 및 인수 서비스; 대출을 다루는 국제 모기지 보험 및 재보험 사업. 라이센스를 받은 독립적인 소매 및 도매 브로커 그룹을 통해 제품을 판매합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Risk Capital Holdings, Inc.로 알려졌습니다. Arch Capital Group Ltd.는 1995년에 설립되었으며 버뮤다주 Pembroke에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":110.17,"mcap":35863126016.0,"pe":9.008177,"fpe":11.041545,"peg":null,"ps":1.9098481,"pb":1.6155617,"ev_ebitda":6.901,"div":0.0,"beta":0.194,"hi52":113.63,"lo52":87.05},"fin":{"rev":18777999360.0,"rev_g":-0.089,"eps_g":-0.157,"gross":0.3764,"op":0.27096,"net":0.23309,"roe":0.18741,"fcf":3900875008.0,"cash":4464999936.0,"debt":4286000128.0,"de":18.641,"eps":12.23,"feps":9.97777},"own":{"short":0.0318,"inst":0.94588,"insider":0.0292},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":113.57895,"median":111.0,"high":140.0,"low":97.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.3,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Keefe, Bruyette & Woods","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":106.0,"priorPriceTarget":95.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":125.0,"priorPriceTarget":120.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":119.0,"priorPriceTarget":107.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":111.0,"p